{title: Footsteps of Jesus}
{artist: Mary Slade & Asa Everett}
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 84}

Verse 1
[G]Sweetly, Lord, have we [C]heard thee [G]calling, "Come, follow [D]me!"
And we [G]see where thy [C]footprints [G]falling lead us to [D]thee.

Chorus
[G]Footprints of [D]Jesus that [G]make the pathway [D]glow —
[G]we will follow the [C]steps of [G]Jesus wher[D]e'er they [G]go.
